[[File:Deepneck Cove.png|thumb|right|300px]]
'''Deepneck Cove''' is a cavern system located on [[Gillijim's Isle]], along the [[Gillijim Strand]]. It runs beneath the [[Maul'ogg Refuge]] and is inhabited with basilisks.

