'''Delgren the Purifier''' is a [[human]] [[paladin]] quest giver located at [[Maestra's Post]] in [[Ashenvale]], working alongside [[Balthule Shadowstrike]] and [[Feero Ironhand]] against the [[Cult of the Dark Strand]]. He fought in the [[Third War]] as part of Lady [[Jaina Proudmoore]]'s [[Human Expedition]] alongside [[Lead Explorer Whitepeak]],<ref name="Bael Hardul" /> and later came to Ashenvale to offer his help to the [[Alliance]]'s [[Night elf|night elven]] allies in their quest to purge the lands of demons and [[undead]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|18|The Tower of Althalaxx (3)|The Tower of Althalaxx}}</ref> Much to the disdain of his superiors, Delgren learned [[Orcish (language)|Orcish]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|28|The Tower of Althalaxx (6)|The Tower of Althalaxx}}</ref>

